== Recent News

- \[July 2025\] Check out [https://robo-mimiclabs.github.io/ MimicLabs], a careful study in collecting and using large-scale manipulation datasets, conducted through the power of simulation and synthetic data generation. We release the [https://github.com/Gatech-RL2/mimiclabs full framework], consisting of data generation code, simulation environments, and datasets.

- \[June 2025\] Check out [https://project-dexmachina.github.io/ DexMachina], a novel curriculum-based algorithm for functional retargeting, enabling learning bimanual dexterous manipulation across several different robotic hands.

- \[April 2025\] We have released the [https://github.com/NVlabs/dexmimicgen/ DexMimicGen simulation environments and datasets] and the [https://github.com/NVlabs/AHA/ AHA codebase].

== About Me

I am a research scientist at NVIDIA AI. I obtained my PhD degree from Stanford University, co-advised by [http://cvgl.stanford.edu/silvio/ Silvio Savarese] and [http://vision.stanford.edu/feifeili/ Fei-Fei Li]. My research focuses on developing systems and algorithms to enable robots to learn useful manipulation tasks.

